From cbc16bdc301c2bd01b3152146d8c35ddff3237ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <EscapeA@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 19:03:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(chat): drop cache-write from composer token display

Cache write is almost always 0 in practice; keep it in the backend
scope=total API response but stop showing it in the input composer
total and detail popover. Total = input + output + cache_read;
detail = input/output/cache read/reasoning (4 lines).
---
